# Package Management

**CRITICAL: NEVER run pip directly!**

- ❌ NEVER use `pip install`
- ❌ NEVER use `pip3 install`
- ❌ NEVER use `python -m pip install`
- ❌ NEVER use any pip command directly

**ALWAYS use the provided script:**
- ✅ ONLY use `./02_load_requirements.sh` to install/update packages
- ✅ Update `requirements.txt` first, then run the script
- ✅ This ensures consistency and proper virtual environment usage
